ta-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>Are you looking to create a copper water fountain with a distinctive look? When you partner with Midwest Tropical to create your <a href="/water-features/">custom water feature</a> or indoor water fountain, you benefit from working with a company that makes and designs everything in-house. This means you can have the right products and <a href="/materials/">materials</a> to create exactly what you are looking for in your water feature. Copper is among the many materials we offer. With a custom copper water fountain in your home or business, you can create the aesthetic you want all with the superior craftsmanship and designs of Midwest Tropical. You will love the finished design.</p><h2>Choose Copper Water Fountains for a Classic Design</h2><p>A copper waterfall fountain offers an elegant, timeless look for your space, elevating your water feature beyond a basic design. Copper gives a water feature that “old world” feel, making a sophisticated addition to your space. However, it works for modern spaces, as well. Because of copper’s brilliant color, the metal itself becomes part of the artwork of your water feature. While aesthetics may be your primary reason for choosing an indoor copper fountain or copper wall fountain, a benefit of this material is its natural anti-microbial nature. This helps limit any bacteria from growing on the surface, even with constant exposure to moisture.</p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ef3d757" data-id="ef3d757" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1f7944a elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-widget elementor-widget-form" data-id="1f7944a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;step_previo